    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the Pub!!</h2><br>Oh no! Guy has just learned his local pub is closing down! Devastated by the news he goes out to try and save it.<br><br>In this infinite runner you will collect coins, whilst trying to avoid obstacles as you get progressively faster and faster. Hop into a special plane named &quot;The Rob-Mobile&quot; and take to the skies, where new obstacles await!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388670/extras/0807ae8c5855021e17ff524914a21b44.avif?t=1741718230\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Avoid hazards along the ground while collecting coins<br></li><li> Take to the skies where new dangers await<br></li><li> Play as Guy, or one his 8 other friends, each with unique abilities to master<br></li><li> Use powerful special abilities to escape from tricky spots <br></li><li> Explore 3 unique locations with their own challenges to overcome<br></li><li> Learn more about the characters in special side stories<br></li><li> Aim for a high score!</li></ul>",
